cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use this database in research, analysis, mapping, or other work,
  please cite this repository and acknowledge the Nigeria Geological Survey
  Agency (NGSA) as the original source of the mineral occurrence information.

title: "Nigeria Mineral Resources Database"

type: dataset

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: 2026-08-18

authors:
  - name: "whoisOlaxtra"

url: "https://github.com/whoisolaxtra/nigeria-mineral-resources-database"

repository-code: "https://github.com/whoisolaxtra/nigeria-mineral-resources-database"

abstract: >-
  A structured database of mineral occurrence records in Nigeria compiled from
  the Nigeria Geological Survey Agency (NGSA) Mineral Resources Map of Nigeria
  (2023). The database was manually extracted, transcribed, organised and
  structured from the published PDF map, and subsequently reviewed against the
  source map to identify and add occurrence records not captured during the
  initial compilation. The repository documents the source, provenance,
  methodology and limitations of the resulting dataset.

keywords:
  - Nigeria
  - mineral resources
  - mineral occurrences
  - geological survey
  - geospatial data
  - GIS
  - mining
  - mineral resource mapping
  - NGSA

